{
  "uid": "huagent-logs",
  "title": "hu-agent / 日志（Loki）",
  "tags": ["hu-agent", "logs"],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "refresh": "30s",
  "time": { "from": "now-3h", "to": "now" },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "使用说明",
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 0 },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "需启用 `logs` profile（`scripts/quickstart.sh monitoring up --with-logs`，仅 Linux 宿主机）。\n\n标签：`service`（api / worker / postgres …）、`project`（compose 项目名）、`stream`、`trace_id`。\n\n排障示例：拿到响应头 `X-Trace-Id` 后按 trace 过滤 → `{service=\"api\"} | trace_id=\"<id>\"`；只看错误 → `{service=~\"api|worker\"} |~ \"(?i)error|traceback\"`。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "logs",
      "title": "错误与异常（api + worker）",
      "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "huagent-loki" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 10, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 4 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "{service=~\"api|worker\"} |~ \"(?i)error|exception|traceback|critical\"",
          "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "huagent-loki" }
        }
      ],
      "options": { "showTime": true, "sortOrder": "Descending", "wrapLogMessage": true, "enableLogDetails": true }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "logs",
      "title": "API 全部日志",
      "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "huagent-loki" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 10, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 14 },
      "targets": [
        { "refId": "A", "expr": "{service=\"api\"}", "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "huagent-loki" } }
      ],
      "options": { "showTime": true, "sortOrder": "Descending", "wrapLogMessage": true, "enableLogDetails": true }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "logs",
      "title": "worker 全部日志",
      "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "huagent-loki" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 10, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 14 },
      "targets": [
        { "refId": "A", "expr": "{service=\"worker\"}", "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "huagent-loki" } }
      ],
      "options": { "showTime": true, "sortOrder": "Descending", "wrapLogMessage": true, "enableLogDetails": true }
    }
  ]
}
